WEBVTT

00:01.084 --> 00:04.337
Now commencing
the 57th Exterior Scouting Mission!

00:05.422 --> 00:07.340
Move out!

00:12.303 --> 00:16.683
After setting out to establish
a route to Shiganshina,

00:17.225 --> 00:19.978
the Scout Regiment
encountered the Female Titan,

00:20.061 --> 00:23.314
which was believed to be
a transformed human, similar to Eren.

00:27.819 --> 00:29.154
It's not an Abnormal!

00:29.612 --> 00:32.115
It's a person clad in a Titan body!

00:40.290 --> 00:42.834
As soldier after soldier fell,

00:43.168 --> 00:46.921
the regiment rushed
into a forest of giant trees,

00:47.005 --> 00:49.549
much to everyone's puzzlement.

00:49.841 --> 00:53.595
Who could possibly stop it,
if not Squad Levi?

00:54.304 --> 00:55.263
Choose.

00:55.847 --> 00:57.390
Will you trust yourself,

00:57.849 --> 01:01.603
or me, these guys,
and the entire Scout Regiment?

01:04.189 --> 01:05.607
I'll go with you!

01:10.695 --> 01:12.530
Fire!

01:18.870 --> 01:19.871
Oh, right.

01:20.455 --> 01:22.373
There's one thing I need to ask.

01:23.833 --> 01:26.461
Will you be fine
if your limbs get cut off?

01:27.629 --> 01:29.422
They'll go grow back, right?

01:30.006 --> 01:32.383
I'm talking about your actual body.

01:33.134 --> 01:36.638
We can't afford
to have you die on us after all.

01:47.607 --> 01:52.278
This goes to show that the enemy was
prepared to throw away everything.

01:53.113 --> 01:55.907
I never imagined our target
would resort to Titan cannibalization

01:55.990 --> 01:57.992
to dispose of information.

02:00.245 --> 02:02.038
All soldiers, withdraw!

02:03.873 --> 02:05.500
Redeploy the formation!

02:06.668 --> 02:08.670
Return to Calaneth District!

02:13.424 --> 02:14.259
Erwin.

02:14.509 --> 02:16.344
Why did you have
Levi replenish his supplies

02:16.427 --> 02:17.762
when there's no time to waste?

02:18.304 --> 02:19.806
The Female Titan was eaten.

02:20.265 --> 02:23.268
But did you see
the person inside get eaten?

02:23.601 --> 02:24.769
I didn't.

02:25.603 --> 02:26.479
Are you saying...

02:26.646 --> 02:27.522
Yes.

02:27.605 --> 02:30.066
If, as you deduced earlier,

02:30.150 --> 02:34.070
we're dealing with a type that remains
able-bodied after de-transformation,

02:35.238 --> 02:39.659
and if they had equipped themselves with
omnidirectional mobility gear in advance,

02:41.077 --> 02:45.498
that means they're now
wearing one of our uniforms...

02:45.790 --> 02:47.041
Captain Levi?

02:48.126 --> 02:49.586
No. It's not!

02:49.669 --> 02:50.753
Who are you?

02:56.467 --> 02:57.510
Gunther!

03:05.310 --> 03:08.938
...and have blended in
with the rest of us, soldiers.

04:50.123 --> 04:52.333
When the Colossal Titan disappeared,

04:52.834 --> 04:56.504
the person on the inside prepared their
omnidirectional mobility gear in advance,

04:56.921 --> 04:59.549
which allowed for a quick escape
before the steam cleared.

05:00.300 --> 05:02.719
The same thing could have happened here.

05:02.802 --> 05:06.723
But didn't we conclude that
that was extremely unlikely,

05:06.806 --> 05:10.310
based on Eren's condition
after emerging from his Titan?

05:11.728 --> 05:15.440
His equipment was broken,
and even his combat uniform was gone.

05:15.940 --> 05:21.195
Most of all, Eren was so fatigued,
he couldn't even stand on his own.

05:22.947 --> 05:27.618
The Female Titan had the ability
to attract Titans with her shrieking.

05:28.244 --> 05:31.539
The operation failed
because we hadn't anticipated that.

05:32.749 --> 05:35.001
If there are different levels
of mastery to this Titan ability,

05:35.543 --> 05:40.131
we were mistaken to assume that Eren,
a novice, set the standard.

05:41.257 --> 05:45.928
As for this enemy,
we'll need to think more carefully.

05:48.806 --> 05:52.226
If we're withdrawing, does that mean
the operation was a success?

05:52.602 --> 05:58.316
If so, they might have found out
who was inside the Female Titan by now.

05:59.108 --> 06:01.027
I'd love to see her face.

06:01.611 --> 06:03.613
Still, why did the Commander expect

06:03.905 --> 06:07.366
that she would come after us
once Eren left the Wall?

06:07.450 --> 06:11.412
I think it's because
the Titans suddenly stopped attacking

06:11.496 --> 06:14.165
halfway through
their invasion a while back.

06:14.540 --> 06:15.458
What?

06:15.625 --> 06:18.503
They went to the trouble of demolishing
Trost District's front gate,

06:18.711 --> 06:20.880
but they didn't try
to destroy the inner gate,

06:21.297 --> 06:24.217
nor did they take action
when Eren went to seal the hole.

06:25.134 --> 06:29.514
My guess is that something else
suddenly came up.

06:30.932 --> 06:32.517
Like what?

06:32.600 --> 06:35.686
Something that took
the focus off of destroying the Wall.

06:36.270 --> 06:38.356
Something unexpected happened.

06:39.941 --> 06:41.400
Eren's transformation?

06:41.484 --> 06:43.111
I think that's the only possibility.

06:43.861 --> 06:44.821
Which means...

06:45.154 --> 06:46.489
Basically...

06:47.615 --> 06:49.742
It was someone who was there.

06:50.284 --> 06:53.162
Someone who had
actually seen Eren transform.

06:53.663 --> 06:55.915
That person is the Titan!

06:58.751 --> 06:59.752
Gunther!

07:00.294 --> 07:01.879
Eren! Don't stop!

07:02.296 --> 07:03.256
Keep moving!

07:05.591 --> 07:06.884
But Gunther is...

07:08.469 --> 07:10.638
- Who's that?
- Protect Eren!

07:10.847 --> 07:14.308
Damn! What now? Which way do we go, Eld?

07:14.600 --> 07:18.229
There's no time to get our horses!
Head for the headquarters at full speed!

07:25.403 --> 07:28.239
Is it the Female Titan's operator?
Or is there more than one?

07:28.573 --> 07:30.491
Damn! You'll pay for this!

07:30.992 --> 07:33.744
You're going down,
even if I have to die too!

07:34.287 --> 07:35.288
The Female Titan?

07:35.538 --> 07:37.331
You can't be serious. How?

07:37.748 --> 07:39.792
I thought we had caught her?

07:48.050 --> 07:52.221
If the enemy can remain able-bodied,

07:53.723 --> 07:57.310
it's possible it can
make the Titan reappear too.

08:01.647 --> 08:02.565
I knew it!

08:02.940 --> 08:03.900
It's coming!

08:04.650 --> 08:06.068
The Female Titan!

08:14.410 --> 08:16.078
Damn. How could you?

08:16.287 --> 08:18.539
This time, I will kill her myself!

08:18.789 --> 08:19.707
No!

08:20.917 --> 08:23.419
The three of us will take her down!

08:23.586 --> 08:26.756
You just keep heading
for the headquarters as fast as you can!

08:29.300 --> 08:31.469
Faced with this opponent,
I've come to realize

08:32.345 --> 08:34.430
that we have no hope
of defeating the enemy

08:34.889 --> 08:37.350
by sticking to the best course of action.

08:37.892 --> 08:40.520
We need to take serious risks
when necessary

08:40.770 --> 08:43.481
and be prepared
to lose everything in a fight.

08:43.856 --> 08:45.191
I'll fight too!

08:45.316 --> 08:46.150
No!

08:46.484 --> 08:50.404
This is the best course of action!
We can't risk losing your ability!

08:50.696 --> 08:54.200
What the hell, man?
Do you doubt our skills or something?

08:54.492 --> 08:55.701
Is that it, Eren?

08:56.244 --> 08:59.247
Do you really have
that little faith in us?

09:02.083 --> 09:04.001
Unless we fight that way,

09:04.377 --> 09:05.795
humanity can never win.

09:12.843 --> 09:14.887
I have faith in our squad's victory!

09:16.430 --> 09:17.557
Good luck!

09:46.002 --> 09:47.044
We've blinded her!

09:47.253 --> 09:49.714
She should be in complete darkness
for at least a minute!

09:49.922 --> 09:52.425
- We'll finish you before then!
- The hell with capturing you!

09:52.592 --> 09:54.427
- We're going to kill you!
- Die a miserable death!

09:54.719 --> 09:56.178
You're going to pay, bitch!

10:00.474 --> 10:02.435
Forget about getting your eyes back!

10:16.240 --> 10:18.868
We're going to shave
your shoulder muscles off

10:19.118 --> 10:21.704
until you can't hold your arms up anymore!

10:26.959 --> 10:28.044
We're going to carve you up.

10:28.210 --> 10:29.211
And lop your arms...

10:29.503 --> 10:30.338
Off!

10:34.050 --> 10:35.051
They're down!

10:37.303 --> 10:38.304
Next is the neck!

10:38.763 --> 10:41.098
Once we sever
the muscles supporting the neck...

10:41.432 --> 10:42.642
We can go for the nape!

10:48.898 --> 10:49.899
They're good!

10:50.316 --> 10:52.068
They have her totally overwhelmed!

10:52.443 --> 10:55.988
And they pulled off a coordinated attack
just like that, without saying a word!

10:56.906 --> 11:00.493
It must be because
they trust each other as teammates.

11:01.452 --> 11:03.496
That's how they've lasted so long.

11:04.288 --> 11:07.333
That's why they're so tough
even right after losing Gunther!

11:10.878 --> 11:11.921
I've got to keep moving!

11:12.546 --> 11:15.841
I just have to trust everyone
and keep moving without looking back!

11:16.258 --> 11:17.718
That's the right choice!

11:18.302 --> 11:19.845
I finally know the right answer!

11:21.889 --> 11:23.224
I don't know the answer to that.

11:25.476 --> 11:26.644
I never have.

11:27.395 --> 11:29.105
Whether I trusted myself

11:29.563 --> 11:32.191
or the choices of my dependable comrades,

11:33.192 --> 11:35.319
there was no telling
how things would turn out.

11:39.824 --> 11:41.492
Say goodbye to your nape!

11:47.081 --> 11:48.165
Eld!

11:55.840 --> 11:56.966
How?

11:57.842 --> 11:59.593
There's no way she can see yet!

11:59.969 --> 12:01.470
It hasn't even been thirty seconds.

12:02.638 --> 12:03.806
Only one eye?

12:04.306 --> 12:06.350
She healed just one eye quicker?

12:06.767 --> 12:09.145
She can do that?

12:10.354 --> 12:12.440
Petra! Pull yourself together!

12:13.732 --> 12:16.110
Petra! Hurry!

12:25.661 --> 12:26.662
That's it.

12:27.580 --> 12:28.664
You're dead!

12:34.712 --> 12:37.548
What? Why didn't my blades penetrate it?

12:56.150 --> 12:57.401
I'm going to...

13:01.238 --> 13:02.615
I'm going to...

13:05.284 --> 13:06.285
kill her!

13:22.051 --> 13:22.968
Eren?

13:23.719 --> 13:25.846
Hey! What? Mikasa!

13:26.138 --> 13:28.265
That roar... Don't tell me it's...

15:34.141 --> 15:37.186
I made the wrong choice.

15:38.687 --> 15:42.316
Choosing to trust my teammates

15:43.317 --> 15:44.693
got them all killed!

15:54.411 --> 15:58.874
If only I had trusted myself and fought
from the very start...

15:59.750 --> 16:03.629
If only I had killed her
from the very start...

16:21.271 --> 16:22.231
Back then,

16:23.440 --> 16:25.192
if I had changed into a Titan...

16:27.569 --> 16:28.487
No.

16:29.446 --> 16:30.698
If I had fought

16:32.700 --> 16:34.743
even earlier than then...

16:36.745 --> 16:38.580
Captain Levi was there too.

16:39.206 --> 16:40.666
We would have beaten her.

16:41.250 --> 16:43.419
We could have even captured her!

16:44.003 --> 16:45.713
You're not in the wrong.

16:46.672 --> 16:47.840
If you want to do it, do it.

16:51.468 --> 16:52.428
I made my...

16:53.220 --> 16:54.430
I made my choice.

16:55.848 --> 16:57.433
And that choice

16:58.017 --> 16:59.977
got everyone killed.

17:01.687 --> 17:03.981
It's my fault they're dead.

17:07.067 --> 17:09.611
But more than anything,

17:10.362 --> 17:11.822
it's all your fault!

17:24.334 --> 17:25.919
I'm going to tear you apart.

17:27.046 --> 17:29.006
Once my hands heal,

17:29.965 --> 17:33.260
I'm going to tear you apart,
piece by piece,

17:34.344 --> 17:36.430
into tiny little shreds,

17:37.264 --> 17:39.099
and then eat you!

19:08.063 --> 19:08.897
A...

19:40.012 --> 19:41.138
Eren!

20:02.784 --> 20:04.328
Wait.

20:05.370 --> 20:06.288
Eren.

20:12.336 --> 20:13.420
Don't go.

20:20.344 --> 20:21.511
Give Eren...

20:26.016 --> 20:27.434
Give Eren

20:27.976 --> 20:29.728
back!

20:47.371 --> 20:49.206
Give him back!

21:03.428 --> 21:05.889
Why can't my blades penetrate it?

21:08.392 --> 21:11.019
He is alive!

21:11.812 --> 21:12.896
Eren

21:13.313 --> 21:14.773
is alive!

21:16.358 --> 21:17.693
Wherever you are,

21:18.068 --> 21:21.863
I'm going to slaughter that woman,
butcher her body,

21:22.406 --> 21:25.534
and get you out of that foul place.

21:26.451 --> 21:27.744
Sorry, Eren.

21:28.662 --> 21:32.207
Just hang on a little longer.

21:39.715 --> 21:40.549
Wait!

21:41.466 --> 21:42.676
What?

21:45.012 --> 21:46.388
Stay back for now.

21:52.602 --> 21:53.937
Maintain this distance.

21:54.646 --> 21:58.358
She must be worn out too.
She is slowing down.

22:00.402 --> 22:02.779
It looked like
she bit the entire nape off.

22:03.572 --> 22:05.032
Is Eren dead?

23:43.255 --> 23:44.673
"Eren is alive."

23:44.965 --> 23:46.341
"Give Eren back."

23:46.967 --> 23:50.220
After helplessly watching
Eren get taken away,

23:50.428 --> 23:53.431
Mikasa fights alongside Levi,
humanity's greatest soldier,

23:53.682 --> 23:55.559
in a battle against the Female Titan.
